# Build / run artifacts
.build/
*.log
# ...except the real execution log the ARM manifest points at
!submission/execution/run.log
# ...and the synthetic example material that happens to be a .log
!submission/examples/mini/materials/train.log

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/

# Node
node_modules/

# Local secrets & session state — never committed
.pg-cli/
.env
*.token

# Test scratch
.tmp/
.testtmp/
.testtmp_old/
submission/examples/mini/work/

# Traces / session logs live at repo root only; anything under submission/ is a
# shipped example and must NOT be caught by this rule.
/*.jsonl

# OS
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
